# Data we collect ourselves (e.g. our own scrapes) is versioned with Git LFS.
# External data is NOT committed at all (see .gitignore) — it is re-downloaded
# with the download_*.py scripts. These patterns only apply to files that are
# actually committed (i.e. placed outside the git-ignored data/ directory).
*.parquet filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jsonl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.csv filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
